/*
 * Declares the CtorDelegateTemplateValue class.
 *
 * CtorDelegateTemplateValue represents a delegate on a class ctor, where the
 * ctor has template parameters and is not yet fully specialized, but will be
 * either by a template call, or implicitely by a standard call.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::delegate::ctortemplate
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/delegate/ctortemplate.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
